\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces GAIL: The policy switcher uses the character’s observation to decide whether to keep the currently activated policy or to switch to the target policy interactively responding to the external control signal when such a transition is considered feasible.}}{6}{figure.caption.6}%
