\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Motion denoising pipeline. Given a 2D pose sequence \(\mathbf {c}\), the model starts from noise \(\mathbf {m}_T\) and iteratively denoises \(\mathbf {m}_t\) for \(t = T \rightarrow 0\) to obtain a 3D motion sequence \(\mathbf {m}_0\).}}{14}{figure.caption.11}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Vectorized timestep modeling for video diffusion. Independent per-frame timesteps increase flexibility, while shared timesteps preserve efficiency.}}{17}{figure.caption.12}%
